### Approve a pending display name (requires dev user authentication)
### Replace {user_id} with the actual user UUID
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/display-names/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer dev_key_change_in_production
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approve": true
}

###

### Reject a pending display name (requires dev user authentication)
### Replace {user_id} with the actual user UUID
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/display-names/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer dev_key_change_in_production
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approve": false
}
